// Verb ontology for S12 Shape Recognition (spec 15 §6.1, §12).
//
// Maps surface verbs to dynamic CLASSES via `imply`, so a shape written on a class fires across stories
// that use different words for the same dynamic (`&Defects`, `&Forsakes`, `&Undermines` -> Betray).
// This is the IR's verb normalizer. A verb may carry several classes.
//
// Read directly by `src/shape.rs`; deliberately NOT imported by `trl/tropes/index.trl` — it must not
// enter the S3 / drams imply closures (it is a recognition aid, not story vocabulary).

// — Betrayal —
imply Defects      -> [Betray]
imply Betrays     -> [Betray]
imply Forsakes     -> [Betray]
imply Undermines   -> [Betray]
imply Transgresses -> [Betray]

// Usurp is a SPECIFIC betrayal: seizing the position itself. Its own niche class (is-a Betray) so a
// `[&Usurps]` shape (Klingon Promotion) matches only seizures, not any/all betrayals — while a broad
// `[&Betray]` shape still catches a usurpation. (Niche-class discipline; see Refute under Reveal.)
imply Usurps       -> [Usurp]
imply Usurp        -> [Betray]
imply Slanders     -> [Betray, Smear]

// — Plant (foreshadow) —
imply Foreshadows  -> [Plant]
imply Foretells    -> [Plant]
imply Warns        -> [Plant]
imply Marks        -> [Plant]

// — Slay (death) —
imply Slays        -> [Slay]
imply Slain        -> [Slay]
imply Dies         -> [Slay]
imply Succumbs     -> [Slay]
imply Destroyed    -> [Slay]
imply Sacrificed   -> [Slay]
imply Sacrifices   -> [Sacrifice]
imply Sacrifice    -> [Slay, Rescue]

// — Reveal —
imply Reveals      -> [Reveal]
imply Exposes      -> [Reveal]
imply Admits       -> [Reveal]
imply Demonstrates -> [Reveal]

// — Refute (a SPECIFIC reveal: disproving a claim, not mere disclosure) —
// Refute is-a Reveal, so `[&Reveal]`-broad shapes still catch a debunking, but `[&Debunks]` shapes
// match only refutations — not any/all reveals. (Class hierarchy + is-a matching; see shape.rs
// class_closure: events carry the transitive closure, shape patterns keep the direct class.)
imply Refute       -> [Reveal]
imply Debunks      -> [Refute]
imply Refutes      -> [Refute]
imply Disproves    -> [Refute]

// — Rescue (relief) —
imply Relieves     -> [Rescue]
imply Reinforces   -> [Rescue]
imply Rallies      -> [Rescue]
imply Aids         -> [Rescue]
imply Shields      -> [Rescue]
imply Delivers     -> [Rescue]
imply Averts       -> [Rescue]

// — Offer (a way out) —
imply OffersEscape     -> [Offer]
imply OffersRedemption -> [Offer]
imply Pledges          -> [Offer, Vow]

// — Dash / thwart (hope or plan crushed) —
imply Dashes       -> [Dash]
imply Crushes      -> [Dash]
imply Thwarts      -> [Dash]
imply Fails        -> [Dash]

// — Deceive / scheme —
imply Schemes      -> [Deceive]
imply Frames       -> [Frame, Smear]
imply Frame        -> [Deceive]
imply Feints       -> [Deceive]
imply Swaps        -> [Swap]
imply Swap         -> [Deceive]
imply Disables     -> [Disable]
imply Disable      -> [Deceive]
imply Forged       -> [Deceive]
imply Stages       -> [Stage]
imply Stage        -> [Deceive]

// — Strike (attack) —
imply Strikes      -> [Strike]
imply Finishes     -> [Strike, Slay]
imply Bombards     -> [Bombard]
imply Bombard      -> [Strike]
imply Breaches     -> [Strike]
